Guomi profile build of the FISCO contracts (spec 04, M15). assemble.sh applies this to a copy of src/ with
patch --fuzz=0, so a change to these lines in the main sources makes the SM build fail loudly instead of drifting.
Board.sign stores member signatures as opaque bytes, attributed to the submitting member's FISCO account (an SM
chain hashes with SM3 and cannot compute the Base EIP-712 digest); digestOf and domainSeparator revert instead of
returning SM3 values. Base verifies every signature in both profiles.

